.TH DANBY-DISEASEBIRTHDEATH1 1
.SH NAME
danby-diseasebirthdeath1 \- SIR disease with balanced demographic turnover
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/diseasebirthdeath1
.SH MODEL
S' = mu-beta SI-mu S;
I' = beta SI-(gamma+mu)I;
R' = gamma I-mu R.
.PP
Births enter susceptible at rate mu and all compartments experience the same
natural death rate.  For S+I+R=1, births exactly balance deaths.  Unlike the
closed SIR model, replenished susceptibles can support an endemic equilibrium.
.SH CONTROLS
Drag a compartment bar.  Tracks set contact, recovery, and turnover.  Space
pauses, period steps, r resets, and q exits.
.SH NUMERICS
The regression suite verifies conservation on the unit population simplex.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/diseasebirthdeath1.b
.br
.B /appl/temple/diseasebirthdeath1.b
